sequenceDiagram
    accTitle: Ticketless Enterprise conceptual support interaction
    accDescr: Illustrative interaction derived from the author's resume. Voice and screen context inform an enterprise-retrieval-supported workflow. A human reviews the proposed resolution and closure requires structured verification. Repository behavior has not been independently verified.
    autonumber
    participant User as Employee
    participant Context as Voice / Screen Context
    participant Agent as LangGraph Workflow
    participant RAG as Enterprise RAG
    participant Reviewer as Human Reviewer
    participant Verify as Structured Verification

    User->>Context: Describe issue and provide screen context
    Context->>Agent: Recognized speech + VLM/OCR observations
    Agent->>RAG: Retrieve relevant enterprise knowledge
    RAG-->>Agent: Supporting context
    Agent->>Reviewer: Present proposed resolution for approval
    alt Approval and verification succeed
        Reviewer-->>Agent: Approve resolution
        Agent->>Verify: Check resolution outcome
        Verify-->>Agent: Outcome confirmed
        Agent-->>User: Verified closure
    else Approval or verification incomplete
        Agent-->>User: Continue support without closure
    end
